WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.800
It’s free for Windows,
with no subscription.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.080
First, add the video you want
to turn into clips.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:12.180
Choose the format and duration.
I used portrait here.

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.720
You can also choose a subtitle style
and check it in the preview.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:22.000
Click Generate and let AI
create the clip.

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:25.980
Download SharpClips AI
from the official website.
